    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">MOVT (vector to table)</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Move vector register to ZT0</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction copies the source vector register to ZT0 at the vector length offset
specified by the immediate index. When the index is zero, the instruction
writes zeros to the most significant (512-VL) bits of the ZT0 register.
When the index is not zero, the unindexed portions of ZT0 remain unchanged.</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction is unpredicated.</p>
    
    <h3 class="classheading"><a id="iclass_sme2"></a>SME2 class
        <span style="font-size:smaller;"><br></br>(FEAT_SME_LUTv2)
          </span></h3><p class="desc"></p><div class="regdiagram-32"><table class="regdiagram"><thead><tr><td>31</td><td>30</td><td>29</td><td>28</td><td>27</td><td>26</td><td>25</td><td>24</td><td>23</td><td>22</td><td>21</td><td>20</td><td>19</td><td>18</td><td>17</td><td>16</td><td>15</td><td>14</td><td>13</td><td>12</td><td>11</td><td>10</td><td>9</td><td>8</td><td>7</td><td>6</td><td>5</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="firstrow"><td class="lr">1</td><td class="l">1</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td class="r">1</td><td class="lr">1</td><td class="l">1</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="lr">0</td><td colspan="2" class="lr">off2</td><td class="l">0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td class="r">1</td><td colspan="5" class="lr">Zt</td></tr><tr class="secondrow"><td></td><td colspan="2"></td><td colspan="4"></td><td colspan="7"></td><td></td><td colspan="2"></td><td></td><td colspan="2"></td><td colspan="7" class="droppedname">opc</td><td colspan="5"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="encoding"><div class="encoding__label"><h4 class="encoding">Encoding</h4><a id="movt_zt_z_"></a></div><p class="asm-code">MOVT  ZT0{[<a href="#offs__9" title='Is the vector length offset, in the range 0 to 3, defaulting to 0 when omitted, encoded in the "off2" field.'>&lt;offs&gt;</a>, MUL VL]}, <a href="#Zt" title='Is the name of the scalable vector register to be transferred, encoded in the "Zt" field.'>&lt;Zt&gt;</a></p></div><h4>Decode</h4><p class="pseudocode">if !IsFeatureImplemented(FEAT_SME_LUTv2) then <a href="shared_pseudocode.html#func_EndOfDecode_1" title="">EndOfDecode</a>(<a href="shared_pseudocode.html#enum_Decode_UNDEF" title="">Decode_UNDEF</a>); end;
let t : integer = UInt(Zt);
let imm : integer = UInt(off2);</p>
